  "content": "<h1><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1151/145/archers_expansion_banner-png.png\" alt=\"\"></h1><hr><h1>🏹更多弓箭手內容！</h1><hr><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/loader-fabric|neoforge-black?style=for-the-badge&amp;labelColor=black&amp;color=grey\" alt=\"加載器\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252farchers-expansion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/modrinth-black?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;labelColor=black&amp;color=grey\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fAShKd5XrTu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1209063880790376468?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;label=discord&amp;labelColor=black&amp;color=grey\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ffichteee\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/donations-black?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=kofi&amp;labelColor=black&amp;color=grey\" alt=\"KoFi\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/ProfessorFichte/Archers-Expansion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/github-black?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;labelColor=black&amp;color=grey\" alt=\"Github\"></a></p><hr><h1><strong>📂 安裝指南</strong></h1><h3><strong>🚨必備模組</strong></h3><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spell-engine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spell Engine</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-rpg-classes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">More RPG Library</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/archers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Archers</a></li>\n</ul><h3><strong>👍強烈推薦模組</strong></h3><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Combat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-n-explore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Loot &amp; Explore</a> &amp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lne-archers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">LNE Archers</a></li>\n</ul><hr><h1>🏹&nbsp;<strong>特色內容</strong></h1><p><strong>這些弓箭手子職業將為所有遠程武器愛好者帶來更豐富的遊戲體驗！</strong></p><h1><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1370/831/archerse_showcase-png.png\" alt=\"\"></h1><h2><strong>✨法術技能</strong></h2><p>利用全新多樣的弓箭技能，讓戰鬥更加有趣！裝備法術書並解鎖所有強大法術即可使用。</p><p>在村莊的<a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gazebos\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">涼亭</a>中找到法術綁定台，或自行建造（別忘了在法術綁定台周圍放置書架）。</p><p>使用法術書的方法：裝備法術書並手持武器（原版或第三方模組武器皆可）。</p><h1><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1370/832/archerse_spellbinding-png.png\" alt=\"\"></h1><h2><strong>賞金獵人名單</strong></h2><p>提供賞金獵人的技巧，包含快速詭詐的射擊，以及能施加負面狀態效果的致命箭矢。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1370/833/deadeye_spells-png.png\" alt=\"\"></p><h2><strong>寒霜狩獵</strong></h2><p>提供帶有冰凍效果的箭矢，可造成寒冷傷害並持續減緩敵人速度。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1370/834/tundra_hunter_spells-png.png\" alt=\"\"></p><h2><strong>戰爭射箭指導</strong></h2><p>提供高爆發傷害、爆炸箭矢與厚重護甲，打造更安全的弓箭手遊玩風格。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1370/835/war_archer_spells-png.png\" alt=\"\"></p><h2>更多弓箭手裝備</h2><p>為新子職業解鎖帶有弓箭相關加成的新護甲套裝！</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1370/830/archerse_armors-png.png\" alt=\"\"></p><hr><h2>歡迎在您的模組包、影片等作品中自由使用本模組。如需提供模組反饋或回報錯誤，歡迎加入我的 Discord 伺服器！ :)</h2><h2>⚙️配置設定</h2><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;</p><ul><li>config/archers_expansion/effects.json</li><li>config/archers_expansion/items.json</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p></div><h2>🎥 展示影片</h2><div class=\"spoiler\"><p><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Xhst1_TfmcE\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></p></div><h1>🙌鳴謝名單</h1><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;</p><ul><li>感謝 Deadelus 創建出色的 Spell Engine API</li><li>感謝 Riot Games 創作《英雄聯盟》並啟發寒霜弓箭手法術（艾希的法術）</li><li>感謝 ArenaNet 創作《激戰2》並啟發神射手與戰爭弓箭手法術</li><li>感謝 Damienbrittan 製作精美的模組橫幅！</li><li>感謝<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsirghaith.artstation.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">SirGaith</a> 製作法術書材質</li><li>感謝<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://slepykat.carrd.co/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Slepykat&nbsp;</a>製作護甲套裝模型</li></ul></div><hr><h3><strong>🧙‍♂️查看我的其他 RPG 主題模組！</strong></h3><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/berserker-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1370/710/berserker_mod_275-png-png.png\" alt=\"\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/elemental-wizards-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1370/711/elemental_wizards_275-png-png.png\" alt=\"\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forcemaster-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1370/712/forcemaster_275-png-png.png\" alt=\"\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/witcher-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1370/713/witcher_mod_275-png-png.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p><hr><h2><strong>想體驗更多 RPG 內容？查看 Daedelus 創建的 RPG 系列模組！</strong></h2><p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/archers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/755/169/archers_full_275.png\" alt=\"弓箭手\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/paladins-and-priests\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/755/170/paladins_full_275.png\" alt=\"聖騎士\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wizards\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/755/171/wizards_full_275.png\" alt=\"巫師\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rogues-and-warriors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/899/332/rogues_full_bg_275.png\" alt=\"盜賊\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jewelry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/760/387/jewelry_full_275.png\" alt=\"珠寶\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/relics-rpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1103/296/relics_275-png.png\" alt=\"遺物\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/arsenal-rpg-series\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1103/295/arsenal_full_275-png.png\" alt=\"軍械庫\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/armory-rpg-series\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1311/866/armory_275-png.png\" alt=\"武器庫\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/skill-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1311/865/skilltree_275-png.png\" alt=\"技能樹\"></a></p><hr><h2><strong>查看其他 Spell Engine 開發者創建的更多 RPG 內容</strong></h2><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rpg-minibosses-forsaken-adventurers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1358/177/anarchy-png.png\" alt=\"無政府狀態\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mercenaries-and-artificers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/857/merc_275-png.png\" alt=\"傭兵與工匠\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/death-knights\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/953/998/death_knights_275_2.png\" alt=\"死亡騎士\"></a></p>",
